msgid "The Realsense T265 is supported via `librealsense <https://github.com/IntelRealSense/librealsense>`__ on Windows and Linux. Installation process varies widely for different systems, hence refer to `the official github page <https://github.com/IntelRealSense/librealsense>`__ for instructions for your specific system:"
